    <!--
      The dependencies of a serverless bot, without Vert.x, Netty, MongoDB nor tock-shared:
        <dependency>
            <groupId>ai.tock</groupId>
            <artifactId>tock-serverless-bot</artifactId>
            <version>${tock.version}</version>
            <type>pom</type>
        </dependency>
      The connectors are the ones that declare HttpRoutes: their Vert.x server dependencies, and the server-sent
      events of tock-bot-connector-web-sse (tock_web_sse), are excluded here. Add tock-serverless-sqs or tock-serverless-pubsub to acknowledge the webhooks
      at once and process them from a queue.
      The build of this module checks that the dependency tree has no banned dependency.
    -->
